@startuml
title VOPC - UC-17 Platform effectiveness (design)
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class "Effectiveness page" as UI <<boundary>>
class "EffectivenessService" as Svc <<control>>
class "WorkItemBuilder" as Items <<control>>
class "MetricCatalog" as Catalog <<control>>
class "Run" as Run <<entity>>
class "WorkItem" as Item <<entity>>
class "Baseline version" as Baseline <<entity>>
interface "DeploymentRepository" as Deployments
interface "CleanupHistory" as Cleanups
interface "IdentityRepository" as Users
interface "BaselineRepository" as Baselines

UI --> Svc : report / records / baselines
Svc --> Deployments : Organization runs
Svc --> Cleanups : USER_CONFIRMED cleanups (optional)
Svc --> Users : actor -> User Account
Svc --> Items : build
Items ..> Run
Items ..> Item
Svc --> Catalog : compute(scope, period)
Catalog ..> Item
Catalog ..> Baseline
Svc --> Baselines : append-only CAS
Baselines ..> Baseline
@enduml
